Package: pulzr-thread
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Provides: pulzr-cap-thread
Description: A Thread border router on the gateway's Thread radio.
 OpenThread's border router (OpenWrt's openthread-br) on the radio co-processor
 pulzr-probe found, set up from Pulzar Net: form a network or join one as
 another border router, let devices join, and report the network's state and
 its mesh as Pulzar protocol v1. See docs/thread.md.
